abstract: >
  Function Tunnel Runtime Invariant Algebra (FTRIA) establishes a unified
  mathematical framework for Runtime Intelligence through Runtime Invariant
  Geometry and Runtime Invariant Algebra. The repository introduces Runtime
  Invariants, Runtime Configuration Spaces, Runtime Structural Organization,
  Runtime Invariant Discovery, Extension, and Trigger Algebra as common
  mathematical abstractions for understanding Runtime Intelligence across
  Structural Intelligence, Artificial Intelligence, software engineering,
  and future Runtime Engineering.

